nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 638.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.2pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"851\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Direct smears: air-dried or fixed</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 638.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"851\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Cytospins: air-dried or fixed</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 638.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"851\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Imprints</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 638.1pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"851\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><span style=\"color: black; \">Liquid-based cytology</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"29\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 616.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"822\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\" tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; \"><span style=\"\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; \">ThinPrep (Hologic)&nbsp;&ndash; collected in CytoLyt and PreservCyt (methanol-based and contain mucolytic and haemolytic agents)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\" page-break-inside: avoid; height: 17.15pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.05pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"28\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 21.5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"29\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 616.6pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 17.15pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"822\">\r\n<p class=\"TableBullet\" style=\" tab-stops: 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; \"><span style=\"\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; \">SurePath (BD)&nbsp;&ndash; collected in <span style=\"\">CytoRich</span> Red (ethanol-based)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
